apartments for rent,  help wanted, etc.) ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The seller writes a classified ad. They  pay for each word, and are often very brief. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "They use descriptive language to get the reader's attention. <br/> <br/>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "for rent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a house or apartment that you pay to the owner to live in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is that apartment for rent?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a classified ad."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spacious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a large amount of space"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at this spacious living room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fireplace"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a special place built in a room where a fire can be lit "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This apartment even has a fireplace!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hardwood floor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "flooring made from the strong, heavy wood of certain trees"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer hardwood floors to carpet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "countertop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area on top of cupboards where items are put"}, {"type": "pa